UPDATE companies SET description='OVR Technology is based in Burlington, Vermont, where a multidisciplinary team of industrial designers, fragrance designers, neuroscientists, and software engineers developed the Omara Scent Display, a personal device that brings olfactory immersion to video games.

The company produces two models: the Omara Core, a desktop scent display with ten scent channels priced at $179, and the Omara Pro, a portable advanced display with sixteen channels priced at $649.

OVR Technology serves the video gaming and virtual reality markets, targeting both end users—gamers seeking deeper immersion—and creators, including independent game studios worldwide that partner with the company to integrate scent into their titles.

