UPDATE companies SET description='Obex Packaging, Inc. operates from Reno, Nevada, where it was founded more than two decades ago as a family-owned business. The company entered the printing and film industry with a focus on gravure printing for long-run packaging applications.

The company specializes in rotogravure printing to produce custom packaging, stock packaging, and labels. Its capabilities include die-cut pouches, inside-print security features, anti-tamper labels, and hand-hole cutting for easier handling. Obex serves over 250 brands, ranging from startups to global market leaders, though it does not disclose facility size, headcount, or annual volume.

The firm emphasizes its ability to tailor packaging solutions to exact specifications, whether for custom-branded runs or off-the-shelf stock items.

