UPDATE companies SET description='Oceanside Welding & Fabrication operates from Oakland Park, Florida, serving Broward and Palm Beach counties. The company was started by Jerry Menagh, who brought years of hands-on welding and aluminum fabrication experience to a small local operation that has grown into a family-owned shop.

The shop fabricates custom aluminum railings, gates, and fencing for residential and commercial properties, along with lanai column repair, trailer repair and fabrication, and general custom metal work in aluminum, stainless steel, and mild steel. Projects are handled in-house from design through cutting, welding, and installation, with powder coating coordinated as needed. A CNC plasma cutting capability is slated to come online soon. Both mobile on-site welding and in-shop fabrication are offered.

Customers include homeowners, builders, and property managers throughout South Florida, as well as marine clients needing pontoon repairs and landscaping or pressure-washing businesses requiring custom trailers. The company''s work is tailored to withstand the region''s coastal climate.

Menagh founded the business on a principle of doing the job right with pride, emphasizing craftsmanship, integrity, reliability, safety, and community. The company highlights transparent quoting, dependable timelines, and a fully welded, powder-coated product built for Florida''s environment as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Aluminum welding", "Custom aluminum fabrication", "Aluminum railing fabrication", "Aluminum gate fabrication", "Aluminum fencing fabrication", "Lanai column repair and welding", "Custom metal fabrication (aluminum, stainless steel, mild steel)", "Trailer repair and fabrication", "CNC plasma cutting", "Mobile welding", "In-shop fabrication", "Powder coating coordination", "Design and engineering", "Installation services"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Property management", "Marine repair", "Landscaping", "Pressure washing"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Stainless steel", "Mild steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mobile and in-shop welding service", "Family-owned and insured", "Fully welded, powder-coated aluminum systems for coastal climates", "Transparent quotes and dependable timelines", "Specialists in aluminum railings, gates, fencing, and lanai column repair"], "facts_used": ["Founded by Jerry Menagh -> /about", "Family-owned business -> /about", "Headquarters at 4340 NE 5th Terrace, Oakland Park, FL -> /about", "Services: aluminum railings, gates, fencing, lanai column repair, custom metal fabrication, trailer repair -> /about, /services", "Mobile and in-shop welding -> /about, /", "Serves Broward and Palm Beach Counties -> /, /about", "Materials: aluminum, stainless steel, mild steel -> /services", "CNC plasma cutting coming soon -> /about", "Powder coating coordination -> /about", "4.9-star Google rating with 230+ reviews -> /, /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_