UPDATE companies SET description='Oklahoma Plastic Enterprises, LLC operates from Sapulpa, Oklahoma, where a trio of out-of-state investors acquired the former Branchcomb, Inc. on August 22, 2012. Branchcomb had been a custom injection and extrusion molder for over 27 years. The new ownership brought a management team with more than 40 years of plastics industry experience and 75 years of combined business leadership.

The company provides custom injection molding, plastic extrusion, and blow molding, supported by a tool shop, mold design, hot stamping, and distribution/assembly services. The facility also stamps and imprints extruded parts and runs daily shipping for customer inventories. Management plans to expand to two or three shifts, six days a week.

