UPDATE companies SET description='Otter Tail Power Company is an electric utility headquartered in Devils Lake, North Dakota. The company has provided electricity to communities across the region for more than a century, though a specific founding year is not publicly stated. It operates as a regulated utility serving customers in North Dakota, Minnesota, and South Dakota.

