UPDATE companies SET description='PGT Energy Solutions operates from Tempe, Arizona, serving the Phoenix metropolitan area. The company reports over 25 years of experience in the energy industry, though a specific founding year is not disclosed. Ownership details and founder names are not publicly stated.

The firm provides residential and commercial solar photovoltaic installation, battery energy storage systems, and grid-charged battery solutions designed for load shifting and backup power. The company works with equipment such as Tesla Powerwall and emphasizes configurations that avoid peak utility rates from Arizona Public Service (APS) and Salt River Project (SRP) without requiring rooftop solar. No facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures are published.

PGT Energy Solutions targets Arizona homeowners and businesses seeking to reduce electricity costs through time-of-use optimization and demand charge reduction. Typical customers include residents on APS or SRP rate plans who want to store off-peak grid electricity for use during peak hours, as well as commercial clients aiming to lower demand charges. The company also assists clients in accessing the 30% federal investment tax credit and Arizona-specific battery rebates.

