UPDATE companies SET description='Pacific Medical, Inc. was founded in 1987 by John Petlansky and is headquartered in Tracy, California. The company began with roots in eight western states and has grown into a nationally recognized distributor and service provider in the durable medical equipment space, focusing on orthopedic rehabilitation and surgical orthopedics.

